            <h3>7. Text Rendering Capabilities</h3>
            <p><strong>Improved but not best-in-class</strong></p>

            <p>V6 improved text rendering but Midjourney still struggles with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Complex typography (Ideogram is better)</li>
                <li>Long text passages (often garbled)</li>
